+
+---
+
+#### [Legal Statute Identification](https://github.com/Law-AI/legal-statute-identification)
+> **Description:** This repository targets automatic statute identification, which is one of the most directly useful legal AI tasks for research, litigation support, and legal aid interfaces. The Law-AI organization frames it as a focused legal task repository rather than a broad platform, and that is exactly why it is useful in an awesome list: it solves a real legal retrieval problem with code that can be adapted to local corpora and workflows.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/Law-AI/legal-statute-identification](https://github.com/Law-AI/legal-statute-identification)
+- **Stars:** 5 ⭐
