+
+---
+
+#### [Law-AI Summarization](https://github.com/Law-AI/summarization)
+> **Description:** The Law-AI summarization repository collects implementations of summarization algorithms applied to legal case judgments. Its orientation is practical and academic at the same time: experiment with methods, compare approaches, and adapt them to judgment summarization workflows. For lawyers, it is not a turnkey desktop app, but it is a useful foundation if your team needs controlled summarization of long opinions, orders, or case records in-house.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/Law-AI/summarization](https://github.com/Law-AI/summarization)
