+
+---
+
+#### [DELSumm](https://github.com/Law-AI/DELSumm)
+> **Description:** DELSumm is an unsupervised summarization algorithm for legal case judgments. The repository description is concise, but the legal value is clear: generate domain-specific summaries of judgments without requiring the same kind of labeled data as supervised systems. That makes it especially useful in jurisdictions or practice areas where annotated legal summary datasets are limited. It is best treated as a research-grade component for legal summarization pipelines.
+
